{
  "id": "09-fabric-capacity-costs",
  "title": "Before you pause Fabric capacity",
  "duration": 33.856,
  "beats": [
    {
      "text": "Pausing Fabric capacity does not stop the charge for a reservation you already bought.",
      "asset": "reservation",
      "device": "tile",
      "start": 0.0,
      "end": 5.1733,
      "voice_end": 5.0133
    },
    {
      "text": "A reservation discount applies hour by hour. Unused hours do not carry forward.",
      "asset": "reservation",
      "device": "focus",
      "start": 5.1733,
      "end": 10.4107,
      "voice_end": 10.2507
    },
    {
      "text": "So check how your reservation benefit is being used before you pause capacity.",
      "asset": "reservation",
      "device": "sequence",
      "start": 10.4107,
      "end": 15.136,
      "voice_end": 14.976
    },
    {
      "text": "There is a second check. Remaining cumulative overages and smoothed operations are added to your Azure bill when you pause.",
      "asset": "pause",
      "device": "focus",
      "start": 15.136,
      "end": 22.4213,
      "voice_end": 22.2613
    },
    {
      "text": "Use the Capacity Metrics app to inspect the capacity's usage.",
      "asset": "pause",
      "device": "sequence",
      "start": 22.4213,
      "end": 26.208,
      "voice_end": 26.048
    },
    {
      "text": "Before pausing, check the reservation and pending usage together. A green pause button does not erase an existing commitment.",
      "asset": "reservation",
      "device": "focus",
      "start": 26.208,
      "end": 33.856,
      "voice_end": 33.696
    }
  ],
